        "text_path": "data/raw/news_pilot/NEWS-guildford_dragon-dce210d89e84.txt",
        "extract": "A Conservative candidate to fight for the Stoughton Ward in the forthcoming Borough by-election on May 2nd has been selected. She is Sharon Stokes.\nThe by-election has been called following the resignation of Lib Dem Cllr Wendy May who is moving back to Canada with her family.\nMs Stokes\u2019s family first moved to Stoughton when she was seven years old. Since then she has lived in Guildford for most of her life including residence in Stoughton for the last 10 years. She works locally in the centr...",
